    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af021d86750e1895fcb4ab6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩将会持续奔跑──\n以一名追求极速的运动员之姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b1712d7c1e19da11e1dc7e31a83ebb9ad5d1921d791f588b0a0afaefd4e6e7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
