    {
      "uid": "zhcn:213c9082d1b08dfe2da82843",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩在同一年称霸了两大大奖赛，\n于是我问她还有什么梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c8ef887ec7163d255f8a7998842db9d7b5b41dbc8e701e3f4885bea5c717e5",
